Summary of design decisions:
- `construct_path(name, lenmax, size, pos, ppos)`: `name` contains the root directory of the tree (the export name), and this function appends "/TREEXXXX" directory components, followed by the "/FILEXXXX" leaf component. `*ppos` = offset within the leaf file.
